## 📄 README.md

```markdown
# 🎯 Practice Interview Platform

A full-stack web application designed to help users practice technical interviews.  
Built using **Spring Boot (Backend)** and **MongoDB (Database)**.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 👤 User Registration & Login (Authentication)
- 🔐 Secure Password Handling with Spring Security
- 🧠 Practice Interview Questions
- 📊 Dashboard after login
- 📝 Forms for:
  - Demarcation Request
  - Mutual Partition Request
  - Family Partition Request
- 💾 MongoDB Database Integration

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Backend
- Java
- Spring Boot
- Spring Security
- Spring Data MongoDB
- Lombok

### Database
- MongoDB (Local)

### Frontend
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- React (optional if used)

---

