## ⚙️ Setup Instructions

### 1️⃣ Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/practice-interview-platform.git
cd practice-interview-platform
````

---

### 2️⃣ Configure MongoDB

Make sure MongoDB is running locally.

```properties
spring.data.mongodb.uri=mongodb://localhost:27017/practiceDB
```

---

### 3️⃣ Install Dependencies

If using Maven:

```bash
mvn clean install
```

---

### 4️⃣ Run the Application

```bash
mvn spring-boot:run
```

Server will start at:

```
http://localhost:8080
```

---

## 🔐 API Endpoints

### Auth APIs

* `POST /api/auth/register`
* `POST /api/auth/login`

### User APIs

* `GET /api/users`

### Request APIs

* `POST /api/demarcation`
* `POST /api/mutual-partition`
* `POST /api/family-partition`

